TI  - CodePori: Large-Scale System for Autonomous Software Development Using Multi-Agent Technology
AU  - Zeeshan Rasheed
AU  - Muhammad Waseem
AU  - Kai-Kristian Kemell
AU  - Aakash Ahmad
AU  - Malik Abdul Sami
AU  - Mika Saari
AU  - Jussi Rasku
