TI  - Co-Sight: Enhancing LLM-Based Agents via Conflict-Aware Meta-Verification and Trustworthy Reasoning with Structured Facts
AU  - Hongwei Zhang
AU  - Ji Lu
AU  - Shiqing Jiang
AU  - Chenxiang Zhu
AU  - Li Xie
AU  - Chen Zhong
AU  - Haoran Chen
AU  - Yurui Zhu
