TI  - SWE-Fuse: Empowering Software Agents via Issue-free Trajectory Learning and Entropy-aware RLVR Training
AU  - Xin-Cheng Wen
AU  - Binbin Chen
AU  - Haoxuan Lan
AU  - Hang Yu
AU  - Peng Di
AU  - Cuiyun Gao
