TI  - SWE-TRACE: Optimizing Long-Horizon SWE Agents Through Rubric Process Reward Models and Heuristic Test-Time Scaling
AU  - Hao Han
AU  - Jin Xie
AU  - Xuehao Ma
AU  - Weiquan Zhu
AU  - Ziyao Zhang
