TI  - Trust Me, Import This: Dependency Steering Attacks via Malicious Agent Skills
AU  - Yiyong Liu
AU  - Chia-Yi Hsu
AU  - Chun-Ying Huang
AU  - Michael Backes
AU  - Rui Wen
AU  - Chia-Mu Yu
PY  - 2026
