TI  - Can LLM Agents Respond to Disasters? Benchmarking Heterogeneous Geospatial Reasoning in Emergency Operations
AU  - Junjue Wang
AU  - Weihao Xuan
AU  - Heli Qi
AU  - Pengyu Dai
AU  - Kunyi Liu
AU  - Hongruixuan Chen
AU  - Zhuo Zheng
AU  - Junshi Xia
