TI  - Beyond Cooperative Simulators: Generating Realistic User Personas for Robust Evaluation of LLM Agents
AU  - Harshita Chopra
AU  - Kshitish Ghate
AU  - Aylin Caliskan
AU  - Tadayoshi Kohno
AU  - Chirag Shah
AU  - Natasha Jaques
PY  - 2026
