TI  - 1GC-7RC: One Graphic Card -- Seven Research Challenges! How Good Are AI Agents at Doing Your Job?
AU  - Robin-Nico Kampa
AU  - Fabian Deuser
AU  - Anna Bößendörfer
AU  - Konrad Habel
AU  - Norbert Oswald
PY  - 2026
