TI  - Helicase: Uncertainty-Guided Supply Chain Knowledge Graph Construction with Autonomous Multi-Agent LLMs
AU  - Yunbo Long
AU  - Haolang Zhao
AU  - Ge Zheng
AU  - Alexandra Brintrup
PY  - 2026
