TI  - Integrating High-Level Requirements to Low-Level Tests with Machine-Readable V&V Specifications
AU  - Mansur Arief
AU  - Nur Ahmad Khatim
AU  - Ali Akarma
AU  - Ahmad Alfan Alfian Irfan
PY  - 2026
