TI  - Does Your Agent Need to Know Its Budget? A Placebo-Controlled Experiment on LLM Coding Agents
AU  - Iftesam Nabi
AU  - Jarif Ul Alam
AU  - Sunzid Hassan
AU  - Sabbir Alom Shuvo
AU  - Md Faiaz Al Islam
AU  - Yead Rahman
