TI  - Research-Native by Construction: Minimal Nodes, Re-verifiable Workflows, and Compounding Memory for Long-Horizon Scientific Agents
AU  - Di Wang
AU  - Yu Liu
AU  - Bing Cui
AU  - Chaoqun Ji
AU  - Dongyuan Ni
