TI  - Beyond the Shadows of Plato's Cave: Evaluating False Memory in Autonomous Agents via Counterfactual Reasoning
AU  - Quan M. Tran
AU  - Zhuo Huang
AU  - Zhen Fang
AU  - Jing Zhang
AU  - Mingming Gong
