TI  - Fly-by-Code: Embodied Coding Agents for Aerial Manipulation with Active Visual and Physical Feedback
AU  - Jaewoo Lee
AU  - Jeongyeon Seo
AU  - Sihyun Cho
AU  - Gyeongrak Choe
AU  - Yutong Wang
