TI  - Well-Specified and Well-Tested? Assessing SWE-bench-Style Datasets with a Self-Evolving Agent
AU  - Zhonghao Jiang
AU  - Xuyang Zheng
AU  - Yanfu Yan
AU  - Zhongxin Liu
