TI  - Agent-Native by Design: A Programming Language for Agentic Applications
AU  - Jayanaka Dantanarayana
AU  - Savini Kashmira
AU  - Xiaoyu Ma
AU  - Malitha
AU  - Malitha Prabhashana
AU  - Lingjia Tang
