TI  - ExRel: Learning Directed Reuse Relevance between Rich-Text K-12 Question Images with Executable Relation Contracts
AU  - Xuexin Liu
AU  - Zengyi Wo
AU  - Shiyu Zhang
AU  - Suqi Cheng
AU  - Daiting Shi
AU  - Xiuyi Chen
PY  - 2026
